[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4260.229, "timestamp": "01:11:00", "text": "その瞬間、その"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4261.59, "timestamp": "01:11:01", "text": "瞬間に、あなたは再び2回目のフェードアウトを起こすでしょう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4262.87, "timestamp": "01:11:02", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4264.87, "timestamp": "01:11:04", "text": "うん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4266.63, "timestamp": "01:11:06", "text": "持っているのか、持っていないのか？   わかった"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4268.31, "timestamp": "01:11:08", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4270.39, "timestamp": "01:11:10", "text": "いいえ、あなたは理解していません。   何てことだ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4271.43, "timestamp": "01:11:11", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4273.189, "timestamp": "01:11:13", "text": "そして、あなたは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4275.83, "timestamp": "01:11:15", "text": "右クリックを押していないと確信しています。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4277.59, "timestamp": "01:11:17", "text": "うん。 よし。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4279.59, "timestamp": "01:11:19", "text": "ああ、だって俺はヤってるんだから、それが見えるんだよ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4281.189, "timestamp": "01:11:21", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4285.11, "timestamp": "01:11:25", "text": "ちなみに、こいつは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4287.03, "timestamp": "01:11:27", "text": "俺が殺したんだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4299.43, "timestamp": "01:11:39", "text": "あ、そこだ。   徐々に明るくしていくことができます"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4301.03, "timestamp": "01:11:41", "text": "。   やった、やったよ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4305.11, "timestamp": "01:11:45", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4307.669, "timestamp": "01:11:47", "text": "彼があなたの胸の上にいるまでは。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4311.83, "timestamp": "01:11:51", "text": "ああ、それは本当だ。 ああ、終わった。 私はジェフを治した"}]